---
import SearchForm from "../components/SearchForm.astro";
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="QuantClarity — inference precision, pricing, and provenance"
  description="Compare public inference-provider precision, pricing, model lineage, and evidence without rankings or tracking."
>
  <section class="hero shell">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">Public facts, kept in context</p>
      <h1>Know what a provider is actually serving.</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        QuantClarity makes inference-provider precision, pricing, model lineage,
        and provenance facts accessible and comparable—without ranking
        providers.
      </p>
    </div>
    <SearchForm />
  </section>

  <section class="section shell" aria-labelledby="why-title">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">Why serving precision matters</p>
      <h2 id="why-title">Two facts that answer different questions</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="fact-example">
      <article>
        <span class="fact-number" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
        <h3>Source checkpoint</h3>
        <p>
          Describes the model artifact and source-provided quantization. It does
          not prove what a provider deploys.
        </p>
      </article>
      <div class="fact-connector" aria-hidden="true">≠</div>
      <article>
        <span class="fact-number" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
        <h3>Provider offering</h3>
        <p>
          Describes the exact tier, endpoint class, and material region
          supported by provider evidence.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
    <p class="callout">
      A wider serving or compute representation cannot restore information
      already absent from a lower-precision source checkpoint. BF16 and FP16
      remain distinct formats; QuantClarity does not imply a universal quality
      order.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section shell" aria-labelledby="principles-title">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">Designed as a public service</p>
      <h2 id="principles-title">Useful because the facts are useful</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="principle-grid">
      <article class="principle-card">
        <h3>Unknown stays unknown</h3>
        <p>
          No fact is inferred from reputation, hardware, naming, speed, or
          expectation.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="principle-card">
        <h3>Neutral by construction</h3>
        <p>
          Affiliate status never affects inclusion, facts, ordering, filtering,
          or prose.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="principle-card">
        <h3>Zero visitor data</h3>
        <p>
          No accounts, cookies, browser storage, analytics, beacons, or click
          tracking.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
